---
description: Rules for the pure-Kotlin domain layer
globs: app/src/main/java/app/idl/domain/**/*.kt
alwaysApply: false
---

- No `android.*` or `androidx.*` imports in `domain/`. It must run on a plain JVM.
- No `Instant.now()`, `System.currentTimeMillis()` or unseeded randomness. Take time via
  parameters or `IdlClock`.
- No dependence on `HashMap`/`HashSet` iteration order in anything that produces output; sort
  explicitly.
- Privacy: functions that compose visuals receive already-filtered input (`VisiblePresence`,
  `PresenceView`). Never re-derive a hidden field from another field.
- New wire enums use `WireEnumSerializer`; JSON goes through `IdlJson`.
